seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# T1: the harness's `send act=answer` on the question dialog closes it
# answered; an approve on a question decides nothing (`passed`).
see busy
half
see prompt question
expect open p1 question par=t1 @500
admit harness act=answer
accept
see busy
expect close p1 question out=answered by=harness
see prompt question
expect open p2 question par=t1
admit harness act=approve
accept
see busy
expect close p2 question out=passed by=harness
